00012 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00013 0000 	;    DCC_Booster is the control and circuit breaker for a model railroar DCC booster.
00014 0000 	;    Features and configurations will be added as needed.
00015 0000 	;
00016 0000 	;    Features: 	Current sensing.
00017 0000 	;	
00018 0000 	;
00019 0000 	;    History:
00020 0000 	; 1.0d4   7/3/2020     Adjusted ISel for 0.25 Amp increments and 2 Amp short detect.
00021 0000 	; 1.0d3   5/27/2020    Added Short Circuit Instant Off. kShortCircuitCurrent
00022 0000 	; 1.0d2   2/29/2020	Ready to do a little testing.
00023 0000 	; 1.0d1   1/12/2020	First code.
00024 0000 	;
00025 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00026 0000 	; ToDo:
00027 0000 	;  Reverser mode.
00028 0000 	;  Test mode.
00029 0000 	;
00030 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00031 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00032 0000 	; What happens next:
00033 0000 	;   At power up the system LED will blink.
00034 0000 	;   Read current select switches, Norm/Rev switch, Test Switch and set mode/control bits.
00035 0000 	;     Set direction bit.
00036 0000 	;   DCC Signal valid? Set/Clear LED and Driver enable.
00037 0000 	;   Monitor current and signal valid.
00038 0000 	;     If over current or invalid signal disable driver, Error rate sys LED, clear dvr/sig LEDs.
00039 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00040 0000 	;
00041 0000 	;   Pin 1 (RA2/AN2) SW5 (Active Low Input)
00042 0000 	;   Pin 2 (RA3/AN3) DCC Polarity (Output)
00043 0000 	;   Pin 3 (RA4/AN4) DCC Signal OK LED (Active High Output)
00044 0000 	;   Pin 4 (RA5/MCLR*) VPP/MCLR*
00045 0000 	;   Pin 5 (GND) Ground
00046 0000 	;   Pin 6 (RB0) Current Select 0 (Active Low Input)
00047 0000 	;   Pin 7 (RB1/AN11/SDA1) Current Select 1 (Active Low Input)
00048 0000 	;   Pin 8 (RB2/AN10/TX) Current Select 2 (Active Low Input)
00049 0000 	;   Pin 9 (RB3/CCP1) DCC Signal (Active High Input)
00050 0000 	;
00051 0000 	;   Pin 10 (RB4/AN8/SLC1) Normal/Reverse* (Active Low Input)
00052 0000 	;   Pin 11 (RB5/AN7) Driver Status LED (Active High Output)
00053 0000 	;   Pin 12 (RB6/AN5/CCP2) ICSPCLK
00054 0000 	;   Pin 13 (RB7/AN6) ICSPDAT
00055 0000 	;   Pin 14 (Vcc) +5 volts
00056 0000 	;   Pin 15 (RA6) MOSFET Driver Enable (Active High Output)
00057 0000 	;   Pin 16 (RA7/CCP2) System LED (Active Low Output)(System LED)
00058 0000 	;   Pin 17 (RA0/AN0) Input voltage sensing analog input
00059 0000 	;   Pin 18 (RA1/AN1) Current sensing analog input
00060 0000 	;
00061 0000 	;====================================================================================================
00062 0000 	;
00063 0000 	;
00064 0000 		list	p=16f1847,r=hex,W=1	; list directive to define processor
